+
+Every token is billed as input on every call it appears in. A specialist's own AGENT.md is the
+cheap, targeted place for a fix; the three shared files are paid on every call. Prefer, in order:
+  - the AGENT.md of the specialist whose output was wrong -- the default home for a fix.
+  - `systemprompt.md` when the PLAN was wrong: a missing or extra step, the wrong specialist, a
