+| path | component | when it is in context |
+|---|---|---|
+| `systemprompt.md` | c1 planner prompt | every planner call |
+| `guardrails.md` | c2 rules appended to every specialist | every specialist call |
+| `LongTermMEMORY.md` | c3 facts appended to planner and specialists | every call |
+| `tool_descriptions/tool_guidance.md` | c4 schema guidance appended to every specialist | every specialist call |
+| `sub_agents/<specialist>/AGENT.md` | c5 one specialist prompt | when a subtask is routed to it |
+
+There are no skills, scripts or plugins in this workflow, and no tool loop."""
